## Step 3: 💹 Bankroll Summary Page

Here's the complete Streamlit code snippet for your Bankroll Summary analytics page:

```python
import streamlit as st
import pandas as pd

# Placeholder Data (replace with real data retrieval)
bankroll_summary = {
    "Total Bankroll": "£15,000",
    "Current Exposure": "£1,200",
    "Daily P/L": "£250",
    "Weekly P/L": "£1,750",
    "Monthly P/L": "£5,600"
}

# Historical Bankroll Data
historical_bankroll = pd.DataFrame({
    "Date": pd.date_range(start="2025-01-01", periods=30),
    "Bankroll": [15000 + i*200 + (-1)**i * 150 for i in range(30)]
}).set_index("Date")

# Page Title
st.title("💹 Bankroll Summary")

# Display Key Bankroll Metrics
cols = st.columns(len(bankroll_summary))
for i, (metric, value) in enumerate(bankroll_summary.items()):
    cols[i].metric(label=metric, value=value)

# Historical Bankroll Trend
st.subheader("Historical Bankroll Trend")
st.line_chart(historical_bankroll)

# Bankroll Changes Breakdown
st.subheader("Bankroll Changes Breakdown")
historical_bankroll["Daily Change"] = historical_bankroll["Bankroll"].diff().fillna(0)
st.bar_chart(historical_bankroll["Daily Change"])
```

